/**
 * Pull request module API client (REQ-6-1/6-2-1..4/6-3-1/6-3-2).
 *
 * Same-origin relative requests through the shared `api` client, so every failure
 * arrives as the uniform `ApiError` payload (docs/architecture.md §3) and forms
 * render field errors next to the matching control. The Commits / Files changed
 * views reuse the M4a `GET .../compare` payload (branch-name handles, §7.2) —
 * this module never re-implements diff arithmetic.
